<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bozorg et al. (2014), Sampathkumar et al. (2014), Hamant et al. (2008) & Uyttewaal et al. (2012) shoot apical meristem pressurized shell stress tensor, stress-vs-strain CMT alignment, and katanin organ boundary morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
